410
00:35:06.930 --> 00:35:11.010
Orlando Bloom 'ile, Katy Perryle,
Hugh Jackmanile, Liam Neesonile,

411
00:35:11.590 --> 00:35:16.170
Macyle ja paljudele teistele.
Nüüd on nende hulgas dokk -patroon

412
00:35:16.170 --> 00:35:18.420
Ukrainast.

413
00:35:19.690 --> 00:35:24.610
Ta kaitseb laste elu alaealiste eest.
Ta on meie partner alaealiste

414
00:35:24.610 --> 00:35:28.230
haridusega,
kes panevad laste elu ähvardama.

415
00:35:34.750 --> 00:35:37.670
Kui patroon tuleb,
siis reaktsioon on selline,

416
00:35:37.770 --> 00:35:40.550
